flowchart TD
  P[Proposal] --> S[Canonical speech]
  S --> L[Assign layer]
  L --> A{Axioms OK?}
  A -->|no| R[Reject or amend charter]
  A -->|yes| N{Naming OK?}
  N -->|no| R
  N -->|yes| B{Baseline OK?}
  B -->|no| V[Major version + dual-speak]
  B -->|yes| C[Conformance update]
  V --> C
  C --> Acc[Accept]
